WEBVTT

00:10.370 --> 00:13.240
This place is so majestic.

00:13.240 --> 00:19.710
They say this is where the humans
held off the demons during the war.

00:19.710 --> 00:23.970
But they were no match for them,
and this place eventually fell.

00:23.970 --> 00:25.170
Oh...

00:25.170 --> 00:27.370
Perugius, the Armored Dragon King.

00:27.370 --> 00:30.130
He was the hero from the Laplace War.

00:30.810 --> 00:33.170
Controlling twelve familiars,

00:33.170 --> 00:35.990
he restored an ancient floating fortress,

00:35.990 --> 00:39.010
then fought and sealed Laplace
with his comrades.

00:39.010 --> 00:44.440
After that, to honor his achievements,
a new calendar was named Armored Dragon.

00:44.440 --> 00:48.960
Lady Nanahoshi, thank you
for allowing us to come with you.

00:48.960 --> 00:51.490
I owe Sylphie a lot after all.

00:55.740 --> 00:57.030
We're here.

01:01.200 --> 01:02.750
What are we going to do here?

01:02.750 --> 01:04.030
I'm going to call him.

01:11.050 --> 01:12.800
I'm not hearing anything.

01:14.690 --> 01:16.180
He's here.

01:20.670 --> 01:23.400
Almanfi the Radiant, at your service.

01:26.270 --> 01:27.360
Isn't he...

01:28.320 --> 01:32.070
When I heard the name Perugius,
I had a hunch.

01:32.700 --> 01:34.970
There's no problem
with our numbers, right?

01:34.970 --> 01:36.780
Your numbers aren't an issue,

01:36.780 --> 01:39.450
but that demon is.

01:39.450 --> 01:40.330
Huh?

01:41.450 --> 01:43.130
Can't you make an exception?

01:43.670 --> 01:48.090
Lord Perugius may be a generous man,
but he hates demons.

01:48.090 --> 01:52.130
It's fine. I'm used to this.

01:52.130 --> 01:54.140
I'll bring you a souvenir.

01:54.140 --> 01:58.510
Give me a big hug when you get home.
That will be enough.

02:01.670 --> 02:03.270
What is this?

02:03.270 --> 02:05.360
Just hold that.

02:05.360 --> 02:08.090
Now, wait just a moment.

02:08.979 --> 02:10.949
This is kind of exciting.

02:10.949 --> 02:12.240
Yes, it is.

02:24.850 --> 02:25.760
Huh?!

02:41.470 --> 02:44.230
So this is Perugius's teleportation magic?

02:44.810 --> 02:46.730
Hey, look at this!

03:00.570 --> 03:06.120
How do you find the view
from our floating fortress?

03:06.120 --> 03:12.880
I'm Lord Perugius's first servant,
Sylvaril of the Void.

03:12.880 --> 03:19.140
Today, I will be your guide around
the floating fortress, Chaos Breaker.

03:29.440 --> 03:31.520
It's been a while, Sylvaril.

03:31.520 --> 03:34.210
Yes, it's good to see you well—

03:34.210 --> 03:36.330
Or maybe not.

03:53.130 --> 03:54.250
Oh my.

03:55.540 --> 03:57.140
Is there some kind of problem?

03:57.140 --> 04:00.550
No, it's not much.

04:00.550 --> 04:04.460
However, would you mind
if I asked you a question?

04:04.460 --> 04:05.810
What is it?

04:05.810 --> 04:09.870
Do you happen to know
the name "Man-God"?

04:15.200 --> 04:17.200
No, I haven't.

04:17.200 --> 04:22.800
Then, do you feel anger or an urge to kill
when you hear that name?

04:22.800 --> 04:24.240
None at all.

04:24.240 --> 04:25.950
Me too.

04:25.950 --> 04:29.960
In that case,
I have nothing more to say.

04:38.630 --> 04:49.020
MUSHOKU TENSEI: JOBLESS REINCARNATION SEASON 3

04:50.100 --> 04:52.520
Are you ready?

04:52.520 --> 04:55.020
Lord Perugius is a generous man.

04:55.510 --> 04:58.560
But I would ask you to mind
your manners nonetheless.

05:26.510 --> 05:31.140
You stand before Perugius Dola,
the Armored Dragon King.

05:31.580 --> 05:34.400
It has been a while, Lord Perugius.

05:34.400 --> 05:36.150
Nanahoshi, eh?

05:36.150 --> 05:38.340
If you're here,

05:38.340 --> 05:42.720
then I take it you've found a way
to summon things from another world?

05:42.720 --> 05:43.760
Yes.

05:43.760 --> 05:47.190
But I do not know
if it is the result you seek.

05:47.190 --> 05:48.700
The results are irrelevant.

05:48.700 --> 05:53.290
We dragonfolk exist to pursue knowledge.

05:53.290 --> 05:59.090
As we agreed, I would like you to teach me
the summoning magic of this world.

05:59.090 --> 06:00.300
Very well.

06:00.740 --> 06:04.430
By the way,
you've brought in quite a large group.

06:04.430 --> 06:08.390
Yes, they helped me
with my research.

06:08.390 --> 06:12.480
I brought them here
to see you as a reward.

06:12.480 --> 06:13.810
Oh.

06:14.520 --> 06:16.730
A pleasure to make your acquaintance.

06:16.730 --> 06:22.290
I am Ariel Anemoi Asura,
second princess of Asura.

06:22.290 --> 06:24.950
It is truly an honor to meet you.

06:24.950 --> 06:27.950
Ariel Anemoi Asura, you say?

06:27.950 --> 06:30.180
I hope we can get to know
each other better.

06:30.180 --> 06:34.990
I assume you came here hoping
I would lend you my strength, right?

06:34.990 --> 06:36.170
Not at all.

06:36.170 --> 06:40.340
I merely wanted to see
the famous hero for myself.

06:40.340 --> 06:44.870
I can see right through you,
Ariel Anemoi Asura.

06:47.390 --> 06:52.020
But your coming here
must also be the work of fate.

06:52.430 --> 06:54.920
You may stay in my castle.

06:54.920 --> 06:58.070
I... I am humbled by your generosity.

06:58.070 --> 07:00.350
And you are?

07:00.350 --> 07:04.780
It is a pleasure to meet you.
My name is Rudeus Greyrat.

07:04.780 --> 07:07.090
Rudeus Greyrat.

07:07.090 --> 07:11.290
I had a lot of trouble
teleporting you here.

07:11.290 --> 07:16.540
If you had resisted back there,
I might not have teleported you at all.

07:17.530 --> 07:20.540
I apologize for the trouble.

07:20.540 --> 07:21.890
No matter.

07:21.890 --> 07:25.540
But your mana resembles much of Laplace.

07:25.540 --> 07:31.060
Do not use that repulsive mana
of yours in my castle.

07:35.980 --> 07:40.330
Of course, I would not dare to oppose you.

07:40.330 --> 07:45.130
Lord Perugius, he is a significant
contributor to my research.

07:45.130 --> 07:47.740
Could you treat him
a bit more kindly?

07:49.470 --> 07:51.710
Very well, then.

07:51.710 --> 07:55.870
What do you want, friend of Nanahoshi?

07:56.330 --> 07:59.080
Money? Power?

07:59.600 --> 08:02.460
Then, I have one thing I'd like to ask.

08:04.590 --> 08:07.920
I see, your mother's illness.

08:07.920 --> 08:09.750
I have heard of ancient labyrinths

08:09.750 --> 08:13.970
that took people captive
and turned them into their very core.

08:14.580 --> 08:17.810
Mana would flow through them
as they become its core,

08:17.810 --> 08:20.310
losing their memories without exception,

08:20.310 --> 08:24.400
and in return, their body
would gain a mysterious power.

08:24.400 --> 08:26.210
Mysterious power?

08:26.210 --> 08:31.210
I believe you call them a Cursed Child
or a Blessed Child.

08:31.210 --> 08:33.409
I don't know the specifics myself.

08:33.409 --> 08:38.440
But I know a woman who suffered
the same fate as her.

08:40.669 --> 08:43.289
Elinalise Dragonroad.

08:43.980 --> 08:46.590
If I remember it right,
about 200 years ago,

08:46.590 --> 08:50.990
you were saved by my companions
from the Bau Labyrinth.

08:51.850 --> 08:53.550
Yes, that's right.

08:53.550 --> 08:55.650
Why haven't you told him about that?

08:55.650 --> 08:59.940
I thought the two of you were acquainted,
since you came here together.

09:00.450 --> 09:01.840
That is...

09:09.820 --> 09:11.790
I'm sorry, Rudeus.

09:11.790 --> 09:15.620
I felt I had to tell you, but I wavered.

09:16.130 --> 09:19.250
Let's discuss this later.

09:22.300 --> 09:24.130
Is there anything else?

09:24.130 --> 09:26.990
Then, would you mind
if I asked you a question?

09:26.990 --> 09:28.050
And you are?

09:28.050 --> 09:29.830
I apologize for not introducing myself.

09:29.830 --> 09:34.260
I am Zanoba Shirone,
third prince of Shirone Kingdom.

09:34.260 --> 09:37.710
Are you here to seek my support
to take the throne, too?

09:37.710 --> 09:40.520
No, I don't care about that at all.

09:40.520 --> 09:43.400
The crest drawn here
is similar to the gate out there.

09:43.400 --> 09:47.780
They're also in that wall over there.
Do you know about them?

09:47.780 --> 09:51.700
I do. That belongs to Chaos,
the Maniacal Dragon King.

09:51.700 --> 09:55.410
Then, might I ask
where this Lord Chaos is now?

09:55.870 --> 09:57.160
He's dead.

09:59.160 --> 10:02.540
Is... Is that so...

10:02.540 --> 10:04.470
He passed away decades ago.

10:04.470 --> 10:07.330
I don't know if he has a successor or not.

10:07.330 --> 10:10.420
By the way,
where did you find that?

10:10.420 --> 10:13.720
It was drawn on some blueprints
for an automated doll

10:13.720 --> 10:16.760
that we found in a rundown house
in the Magic City of Sharia.

10:16.760 --> 10:20.450
I see, an automated doll.

10:20.450 --> 10:22.770
Do you find that kind of thing incredible?

10:22.770 --> 10:24.430
Of course!

10:24.430 --> 10:27.460
The detail in craftsmanship
is truly captivating!

10:27.460 --> 10:32.440
You could tell at a glance
that the creator truly loves dolls!

10:34.170 --> 10:37.580
It seems you are someone
who appreciates art.

10:37.580 --> 10:42.760
All right, in this castle's treasury,
there are several of Chaos's creations.

10:42.760 --> 10:44.540
I will show them to you later.

10:44.540 --> 10:47.560
Oh! I am very happy to hear that.

10:48.100 --> 10:51.260
Would you mind
if I asked something as well?

10:51.260 --> 10:52.750
And you are?

10:52.750 --> 10:56.640
Bodyguard of Princess Ariel,
second princess of Asura,

10:56.640 --> 11:01.640
and the wife of Rudeus Greyrat,
Sylphiette Greyrat.

11:02.640 --> 11:04.770
A married couple, I see.

11:04.770 --> 11:07.600
Before I answer, allow me to ask:

11:07.600 --> 11:09.790
Do the two of you have a son?

11:09.790 --> 11:12.900
Huh? No, but we have a daughter.

11:12.900 --> 11:18.030
If you ever give birth to a son,
bring him before me.

11:18.030 --> 11:20.390
I will name him myself.

11:20.390 --> 11:21.550
Yes...

11:21.550 --> 11:24.260
Now, what is your question?

11:24.260 --> 11:27.360
I would like to ask you about
the Teleportation Incident.

11:27.360 --> 11:31.420
Was that incident caused by someone?

11:31.420 --> 11:33.290
I don't know much
about that as well.

11:33.290 --> 11:37.680
I thought it was Laplace's doing,
or someone connected to him.

11:37.680 --> 11:41.810
But even I can't summon
Nanahoshi to this world.

11:41.810 --> 11:46.880
That means there is no one else
in this world who can do it either.

11:46.880 --> 11:48.230
Which means...

11:48.230 --> 11:50.880
That wasn't anyone's doing.

11:50.880 --> 11:53.320
It was simply a string of coincidences.

11:53.790 --> 11:56.010
I see.

11:56.010 --> 11:57.740
Thank you very much.

11:57.740 --> 11:59.590
Anyone else?

12:00.990 --> 12:06.480
Then, enjoy your stay
in my floating fortress.

12:07.960 --> 12:09.460
Here.

12:09.460 --> 12:11.140
Thank you very much.

12:11.140 --> 12:11.960
It's fine.

12:14.520 --> 12:18.900
When I was rescued
from the labyrinth 200 years ago,

12:18.900 --> 12:21.850
I lost all my memories and emotions.

12:22.400 --> 12:26.560
I was brought into an elven village,

12:26.560 --> 12:30.980
and they welcomed me
even though I was a stranger.

12:31.410 --> 12:34.490
I'm not sure if it was because of that,

12:34.490 --> 12:37.560
but I regained my emotions
after a few years,

12:37.560 --> 12:40.330
and fell in love
with one of the village men.

12:40.820 --> 12:43.490
Even if my memories never returned,

12:43.490 --> 12:45.890
I felt happy back then.

12:46.900 --> 12:51.350
It was then that my curse
began to surface.

12:51.350 --> 12:55.000
I started to want to have sex
every single night.

12:55.410 --> 12:57.540
What's more, once a month,

12:57.540 --> 13:02.320
my body started to give birth
to small magical crystals.

13:02.320 --> 13:04.800
It was terrifying at first.

13:04.800 --> 13:08.520
But, as it turns out, this helped
our household finances.

13:08.960 --> 13:10.450
One day...

13:10.450 --> 13:13.250
My husband, who had gone
to sell the crystals,

13:13.250 --> 13:17.280
was attacked by bandits
and lost his life.

13:17.710 --> 13:23.800
I decided to live alone, cherishing
the memories I shared with my husband.

13:23.800 --> 13:27.350
But my curse wouldn't allow that.

13:27.350 --> 13:33.290
I couldn't suppress my libido
and assaulted every man in the village.

13:33.690 --> 13:39.100
I kept letting my urges take over,
until the village finally banished me.

13:39.550 --> 13:42.830
And after many twists and turns,

13:42.830 --> 13:47.010
I now live as an adventurer.

13:47.680 --> 13:51.310
That's more or less the story of my life.

13:52.810 --> 13:58.360
After that, I started to come to terms
with my curse and enjoy meeting men.

13:58.360 --> 14:01.530
Of course, I'm now loyal to Cliff.

14:03.340 --> 14:06.160
So your memories never came back?

14:06.160 --> 14:08.570
No, even now.

14:08.570 --> 14:13.210
But Zenith's condition
is different from mine.

14:13.210 --> 14:15.970
I think she has a different curse.

14:15.970 --> 14:17.510
Why do you know?

14:17.510 --> 14:20.170
Just a gut feeling.

14:20.170 --> 14:22.990
Anyway, don't let your guard down.

14:22.990 --> 14:26.300
In the end,
we have to keep watching her.

14:26.300 --> 14:29.930
I apologize for not
telling you this sooner.

14:29.930 --> 14:34.220
Rather, I feel sorry for making you tell
an uncomfortable story.

14:34.220 --> 14:38.320
I know the feeling of not wanting
to share my past.

14:38.320 --> 14:42.030
That's why I don't blame her at all.

14:48.970 --> 14:50.790
I see you're all here.

14:50.790 --> 14:54.410
Now, let's begin our lesson.

14:55.000 --> 14:57.590
Although we made no progress
regarding Zenith,

14:57.590 --> 15:00.670
There was an unexpected gain.

15:00.670 --> 15:02.750
Nanahoshi has been kind
enough to ask that

15:02.750 --> 15:06.680
we be included in the summoning magic lesson.

15:06.680 --> 15:09.430
We were still on the very basics,

15:09.430 --> 15:11.930
but I was excited to learn more.

15:15.100 --> 15:17.650
It's about time for a break.

15:17.650 --> 15:20.520
Is there anything you would like to eat?

15:21.600 --> 15:23.190
Anything is fine.

15:23.190 --> 15:25.740
Can we ask for Millis cuisine?

15:25.740 --> 15:30.530
Yes, if we don't have the ingredients,
Almanfi will get them for us.

15:30.530 --> 15:34.790
Is it really okay to treat him
like a high-speed gofer?

15:35.290 --> 15:38.670
Wait, this might be a good chance.

15:42.880 --> 15:45.430
Would this be what you asked for?

15:45.430 --> 15:47.340
Yes, it's perfect!

15:47.340 --> 15:51.030
It's nice to treat yourself sometimes.
Right?

15:51.030 --> 15:53.240
I guess so.

15:54.310 --> 15:57.080
Now, let's put our hands together.

15:58.060 --> 16:01.690
Let's dig in.

16:03.440 --> 16:07.170
I've tried to look for something
like soy sauce in this world.

16:07.170 --> 16:09.200
But I couldn't find it at all.

16:09.200 --> 16:13.190
However, we can replace it
with a fermented bean dish

16:13.190 --> 16:15.830
from the Kingdom of Biheiril.

16:15.830 --> 16:20.460
I asked them to make
a pseudo-Japanese-style set menu with it.

16:22.270 --> 16:25.590
There's no dashi in this miso soup.

16:32.600 --> 16:35.620
It tasted nothing like the real thing.

16:35.620 --> 16:40.340
The Japanese cuisine we remembered
was far more delicate.

16:41.120 --> 16:44.520
But our hands never stopped.

16:48.820 --> 16:51.620
Thank you for the food.

16:57.790 --> 17:00.980
Seriously though,
this castle is gigantic.

17:00.980 --> 17:06.849
I'm still amazed that a building this big
can stay afloat in the air.

17:11.109 --> 17:12.589
Looking around the castle?

17:13.140 --> 17:14.790
If it isn't Rudeus.

17:14.790 --> 17:17.020
I'm curious about what lies ahead.

17:17.020 --> 17:19.670
Oh, seems interesting.

17:19.670 --> 17:21.150
I'll come along.

17:21.150 --> 17:22.560
That'd be a great help, but...

17:23.060 --> 17:25.440
I'm not sure
if we're allowed to go inside.

17:25.440 --> 17:28.190
Right.

17:28.190 --> 17:29.700
It shouldn't be a problem.

17:29.700 --> 17:31.680
Have you been there before?

17:31.680 --> 17:35.200
Yes, most of the rooms are locked,

17:35.200 --> 17:38.180
but there is something
interesting down there.

17:41.580 --> 17:44.270
Is this what you meant?

17:44.270 --> 17:46.840
No, it's deeper inside.

17:48.810 --> 17:51.870
Though it may sound childish
for someone my age, I'm so pumped!

17:51.870 --> 17:52.810
Me too!

17:52.810 --> 17:54.050
Me three!

17:54.050 --> 17:56.800
Boys sure love these kinds of things.

18:07.920 --> 18:10.540
This is incredible!

18:10.540 --> 18:13.740
Murals, I see.
They seem pretty old.

18:14.770 --> 18:19.120
I feel like I've seen this story before.

18:19.120 --> 18:22.160
Me too, but which, exactly?

18:23.670 --> 18:25.420
What are you doing here?

18:26.920 --> 18:29.120
Oh my, Lord Perugius.

18:29.880 --> 18:32.050
Enough. Rise.

18:32.050 --> 18:35.170
Your floating fortress
is truly extraordinary.

18:35.170 --> 18:38.510
It simply makes one's heart
pound with excitement!

18:38.510 --> 18:43.950
But it seems we've offended you
for trespassing.

18:43.950 --> 18:45.150
I don't mind.

18:45.570 --> 18:50.150
These murals weren't created
to please my aesthetic taste.

18:50.150 --> 18:52.450
What do you mean by that?

18:52.450 --> 18:58.450
When I first obtained this fortress,
there was almost nothing left inside.

18:58.850 --> 19:01.290
Only these murals were left intact.

19:01.290 --> 19:04.230
They were in perfect condition, too.

19:04.230 --> 19:08.710
Even as everything fell to ruin,
these murals stayed the same.

19:09.260 --> 19:11.970
I saw a message from my ancestors here.

19:11.970 --> 19:16.720
And I have to pass this on
to my predecessors.

19:16.720 --> 19:19.340
It really tugs at your heartstrings,
doesn't it?

19:19.340 --> 19:24.100
I would like to think like that,
but I'm not fond of these at all.

19:24.100 --> 19:27.010
For some reason, I feel a tightness

19:27.010 --> 19:29.730
and an unpleasant sense
of despair in my chest.

19:29.730 --> 19:34.110
In that case, we shouldn't
stay here too long.

19:36.110 --> 19:39.430
Almanfi, guide them back up.

19:39.430 --> 19:40.370
Yes, my lord.

19:51.090 --> 19:53.930
How did things
go on Princess Ariel's side?

19:54.790 --> 19:56.720
Not very well.

19:57.100 --> 20:02.010
Even when offered peerage or a fief,

20:02.010 --> 20:04.380
he wouldn't even bat an eye.

20:04.380 --> 20:05.930
He's a hero, after all.

20:05.930 --> 20:08.630
I think reeling him in with those
would just work against her.

20:08.630 --> 20:10.060
You do have a point.

20:10.460 --> 20:12.230
If it were you, what would you do?

20:12.230 --> 20:15.000
Maybe I'd try
to get along with him first.

20:15.000 --> 20:18.140
By talking about hobbies or asking him
about his heroic stories.

20:18.140 --> 20:22.450
If someone close to you asks for help,
you'd want to help, right?

20:22.450 --> 20:25.330
When you put it like that,
it does make sense.

20:25.330 --> 20:28.370
Thank you. I'll tell Her Highness.

20:28.370 --> 20:30.250
How are things on your end?

20:30.250 --> 20:32.550
So-so, I guess.

20:32.550 --> 20:35.690
I'm starting to learn summoning magic
with Nanahoshi and the others.

20:35.690 --> 20:39.970
Oh, and I also asked them to replicate
Nanahoshi's homeland cuisine.

20:39.970 --> 20:42.000
They didn't taste good at all, though.

20:42.000 --> 20:44.760
You sure get along well with Nanahoshi.

20:46.350 --> 20:50.520
Huh?! I don't have any
romantic feelings for her at all!

20:50.520 --> 20:52.550
You've got to believe me!

20:54.190 --> 20:57.360
Sorry, I just wanted to tease you a bit.

20:57.360 --> 20:58.900
I-I see.

20:58.900 --> 21:02.380
I have to be more careful when I talk
about Nanahoshi in front of Sylphie.

21:05.250 --> 21:06.490
Coming.

21:07.410 --> 21:09.050
Nanahoshi?!

21:10.790 --> 21:13.790
I'm sorry for intruding.

21:13.790 --> 21:15.730
Don't worry about that.

21:15.730 --> 21:17.640
Hey, are you really okay?

21:17.640 --> 21:20.050
I need some Detoxification.

21:20.050 --> 21:21.430
Let me cast it.

21:21.430 --> 21:22.790
Thanks.

21:22.790 --> 21:24.800
If you don't get any better,

21:24.800 --> 21:27.560
try asking Cliff to cast
a higher-tier spell on you.

21:29.330 --> 21:31.810
Huh? This is strange.

